          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>26 U.S. Code § 72(t)</strong></td>
            <td>10% additional tax on early distributions and statutory exceptions (Rule of 55)</td>
            <td><a href="https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/26/72" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="fzk-inline-link">26 U.S. Code § 72(t) — Cornell Law</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
